lass=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5d8c59019598b33c\" href=\"?note=5d8c59019598b33c\" title=\"92-fact-sub-recursive\">92-fact-sub-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\\)</span> (full induction-schema set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b0214c7ec3ea52ef\" href=\"?note=b0214c7ec3ea52ef\" title=\"92-df-induction-schema\">92-df-induction-schema</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_G\\)</span> (Gödel-code image constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathrm{Ind}}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A_{\\mathrm{Ind}}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (Gödel codes of induction instances)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}\\)</span> (decidable-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRPred}\">\\(\\mathrm{PRPred}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive relation predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}induction\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\nA_{\\mathrm{Ind}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ind}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{PRPred}(A_{\\mathrm{Ind}})\\land\\mathrm{Dec}(A_{\\mathrm{Ind}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}induction\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\nA_{\\mathrm{Ind}}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ind}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{PRPred}(A_{\\mathrm{Ind}})\\land\\mathrm{Dec}(A_{\\mathrm{Ind}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>归纳公理集可判定</li>\n<li>判定方法：先拒绝非法公式码，再检查<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>是否符合归纳模板\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi = \\varphi(0) \\land \\forall x\\;(\\varphi(x) \\to \\varphi(S(x))) \\to \\forall x\\;\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\psi = \\varphi(0) \\land \\forall x\\;(\\varphi(x) \\to \\varphi(S(x))) \\to \\forall x\\;\\varphi(x)\\)</span></li>\n<li>提取<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，验证结构</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>固定文法下的有限语法树解析、候选子式比较与码层代入都是原始递归的；即使某个实例有不止一种生成表示，成员判定只需检验有限个语法分解，不依赖假定唯一逆模板</li>\n<li>这是PA公理可判定的一部分</li>\n<li>公理模式的优势：无限公理但可判定</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"b0214c7ec3ea52ef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pr-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"298d80fabfd2a708","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-pr-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetization-formula","status":"resolved","id":"af5c6b1bb1806001","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetization-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-fact-sub-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"5d8c5901959